<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id">- Alago Bible Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">2 Obitrus</para>
  <para style="toc1">Okpa komwepa bwabo ko Obitrus</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Obitrus</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Obt</para>
  <para style="mt2">Okpa komwepa bwabo ko</para>
  <para style="mt1">Obitrus</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1" />Oshu mani bwabo ko Osimon Obitrus, oyole kpo oyikoko ko Oyesu Okristi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 1:1">Gebe kawase ni adawo otuse neshi kpaha bwebe koza neshi ko Owuso kpino ngmaha Oyesu Okristi ni:<verse eid="2PE 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2" />Oneshi kpo Omene nayo kpala kpiri bwebe ko ogyogye kala ni ala gyo Owuso kpo Oyesu Adole ka ni.<verse eid="2PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oyogwu ko Owuso Kpo Oshoshu Nu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3" />Oshu ko Owuso daha oza kpiri ni aba doka koyagye kese, byoni Owuso ya yimu ni, bwebe kogyogye kase ni yahogwu bwebe kigyashi kpo oneshi nu. <verse eid="2PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4" />Bwebe koni Owuso daha eshi nyakwu ni ki shoshi ni oshokoyi ni, shini bwebe keshi mani ala ka yishi bwebe ko yimu kese lo, kweyi ala wa gbingbo ipu ko olayi ko Owuso. <verse eid="2PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5" />Mani oni, takirikwu shini oyo oneshi mi ikweyi kotuse wo; ipu koneshi wo yo ogyogye manu; <verse eid="2PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6" />ipu ko ogyogye byi kwiyo manu, ipu ko kwiyo byi zotu manu, ipu ko zotu yo oshi ko Owuso manu; <verse eid="2PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7" />ipu ko oshi ko Owuso wo yo otumene kawogboso Okristi manu, ipu ko otumene kawogboso Okristi, yi imu manu. <verse eid="2PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8" />Omani pini wa arinya ni oshu ko gbo ni la, owoni ogbuwa nwashika, aba yo ya yoko neshi ipu kogyogye ka Adole ka Oyesu Okristi. <verse eid="2PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9" />Owoni oke gbuwa lo, oya mebe gebe lenu lo, kweyi omebe lo, onwanyi mo ayo na shozalabi wo kikyikyo.<verse eid="2PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10" />Mani oni, ayene hin, takirikwu kotata shini oyo ogwu kpo oshoshu ni Owuso sho ni na hagye; owoni oya mani, oya sho otuse wo bita lo. <verse eid="2PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11" />Kweyi oya pyo owe ko gipu ko Obula ka Adole kpo Olowoyi ka Oyesu Okristi ni wa ko gbogbo ni.<verse eid="2PE 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12" />Ni olemani oni, ishi kpiri nyya rawo ela mani, koni okwobonu gyuwa neshi kweyi gbogba loshu ipu kokwokwoshi ni onye ni. <verse eid="2PE 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13" />Nma mo oshoshi shini na byi rawo kwurutu byoni ntayoyo yipu ka adaba mani. <verse eid="2PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14" />Nggye mo oya gbeji kelo nyya shi ikpiye ni ya gekwu mani bita, byoni Adole ka Oyesu Okristi ka kyaa dami ni. <verse eid="2PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15" />Nyya takirikwu shini ishini wa ga hin oya rela ka awoza mani.<verse eid="2PE 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Awase ni Migyashi ko Okristi Iyi Wa ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16" />Aha gbosi igwu kokame lalo ishini ako oshu kowowa ka Adole Oyesu Okristi ni. Aha ke mo okwu nu kpiyi ka. <verse eid="2PE 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17" />Aha ma ni Owuso Ada danu abokpa kpi Igyashi ni, ishini oko bwiso ya kamo, &lt;&lt;Omani woyi hin moshi, ni nyya shotunehe kpanu ni!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18" />Aha abiyika pwoko mani bwi iso, ishini ababa kpanu ikweyi kefu neshi ni. <verse eid="2PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19" />Ebeni agye mela ni awobane ka ni wokwokwoshi. Oya shoshi shini ala zakpaha danu, ikweyi koni olema byi ikwomu ni ya yu ipu kebe dibu gbishini ebenya kweyi oyoyu kinyiwo ko otukpokyi ya yu ipu kotu kala. <verse eid="2PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20" />Oni shojoji ni, nyya yimu shala gye mo ashishe ipu kaha ya gege ko gwikweyi koza ni abane ipu ko Okpa ko Owuso lo. <verse eid="2PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21" />Koni oshu kinobane oyoye wa bwebe kimu kasuse lo, Omaku ko Owuso pini ke ya kpase ogwu ishini aba kyoleho ni wa bwebe ko Owuso ni la.<verse eid="2PE 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2" />
  <para style="s">Awofoza ko Okame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1" />Awino bane kokame bipu kasuse nekye-nekye, mamani awofoza kokame ba bose ipu kala. Aba wa foza kokame ko yase yishi, kweyi aba tawashu ka Adole ni ngmawa ni, bwebe koni aba yiyiwa ngmo ishi oye kponu. <verse eid="2PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2" />Mamani ase nwashika ba bwowe bibi wa; kweyi ase shishini ba wa kela bibi ikweyi ko Owe ko Okwokwoshi ikweyi koza ni aba ya ni. <verse eid="2PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3" />Awofoza kokame mani ba wa pya abola bwebe kokame ni aba ka dala ni, ikweyi koni aba yofa kiyo kese. Ino kepwo wa wiyinushu gbeji wa, kweyi ase ni ya yuwa ngmo ni ya gbola lo! <verse eid="2PE 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4" />Owuso sha ayoleho ni yozalabi ni bita lo, oke tuwa gipu kola, ebe ni ashuwa ashirika ipu kebe dibu ni, ba gbeyi ke Eno ko ke Epwo. <verse eid="2PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5" />Owuso she ese nekye bita lo, oyi inyo yese kawase ni gyo Owuso lo ni yi re; awase ni ongmawa ni wo Onuhu, ino tono ko okwokwoshi, kpa ashini kase ahapa fufuwa. <verse eid="2PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6" />Owuso yo ogya ko Osodom kpo Ogomora yola, shini ona sayi koza ni ya wa gbodagye kpawase ni gyo Owuso lo ni. <verse eid="2PE 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7" />Ongmo Olotu, aseneshi ni byotu ikweyi kozalabi kawase ni ba ko ono lo ni. <verse eid="2PE 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8" />Aseneshi mani yagye kpawa, kweyi kurutu otu nu ya bya kotata ishini oma kwe opwela koza bibi ni aba ya ni. <verse eid="2PE 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9" />Mani oni Adole gishi ko ngmase neshi shipu kowe kweyi dase bibi owe gbeyi ke Eno ko ke Epwo, <verse eid="2PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10" />otata wawase ni gboso oza bibi ni ikpiye wa ya yimu ni kweyi amo oshu ko Owuso gyiyi lo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 2:10">Awofoza kokame mani ba yoshi lo kweyi aba lagbiti, ake ba geyagye da awine kigyashi ni bi iso ni lo; abishi koni, aba suwesa. <verse eid="2PE 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11" />Ayoleho ni ke loshu ki gboshu sha awofoza kokame mani kwuwepwo kpe esa sosa obutu ka Adole lo. <verse eid="2PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12" />Awase mani ke ba kela karigbetu ikweyi koza ni agyikweyi nu lo ni, ale bye ebe ka akyashi ni amuwa ko kwuwa ngmo ni; aba sase eyi kpe esa sosa ikweyi koza ni agyikweyi nu lo ni. Aba yuwa ngmo byebe ka akyashi. <verse eid="2PE 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13" />Aba suwore kowe ni adase ni kpowe moma. Ebe wa onye ko moma wako yoza ni ikpiye wa ya yimu ni eno kyakyakya; awoza ki iweyi kpo owuru gbogbo ishini awa roza kpala, ipu kishi kpiri aba kowe ke egya gyogya wa! <verse eid="2PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14" />Oza ni yipu kotu wa ni weba boba kin; aba yipu kpo ozalabi lo. Aba sase ni hagye loshu lo ni abo ko gbo gipu keda. Akwobonu fiyiwa ko yimu kiyiwa kin. Owuso kwobonu yuwo okwunu wa! <verse eid="2PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15" />Ashowe neshi bita kweyi bwowe bibi; azowe ko Obalam oyi ko Obiyo, ni ya yimu ka abola koza bibi ni <verse eid="2PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16" />Owuso gba apwo koza bibi nu. Odagyi nu ni shu ko kela kpoko kasuse lo ni kela kweyi wobi ko onyoza ni inobane mani ya ya ni.<verse eid="2PE 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17" />Awase mani wokpa ni gbinyo lo ni, bya akpa ni owu ya to ni; Owuso shebe bita dawa ipu kebe dibu tiri. <verse eid="2PE 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18" />Aba kela ni gbikweyi lo ni ko zikweyi iso, aba yoko kpikpiye wa ko gyawase ni ba kwotu ko ngmabo shozalabi ni egya bwebe koza bibi kimu kikpiye. <verse eid="2PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19" />Aba shokoyi ko ngmawa she eshe awa abiyiwa ke wawoshe ka arinya labi-oza noya gege ko shibita lo owo oshe nu la. <verse eid="2PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20" />Owoni ase bose shipu kese mani ni ya yishi ni bwebe kogyogye ka Adole kpo Olowoyi ka Oyesu Okristi, kweyi oki kwikye gipu ko yo ozalabi, okweyi wa ya labi sha kikyikyo. <verse eid="2PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21" />Obi ya shoshi she dawa owoni agyo owe ko oza neshi lo, sho olamu ni agye kweyi pyitikpi tono neshi ni adawa ni. <verse eid="2PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22" />Ozani tawa ni sayi mo asuse ni asa ni wo kwokwoshi: &lt;&lt;Iwo kwikye ga roza ni oyi gba ni&gt;&gt; kpo &lt;&lt;Aruma ni agwiye ni kwikye ga ja ipu ko ototo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2PE 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3" />
  <para style="s">Okoyi ko Owowa ka Adole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1" />Ayene hin moshi, omani wo okpa hin ko omwepa ni nyya ta dala ni. Nta awokpa mani pepa dala ko rala mela kotu kala na wa koneshi. <verse eid="2PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2" />Nyya yimu shini ala rela ni aka dala nekye-nekye bwebe ka awinobane ko Owuso ni, kpo ono bwebe ka Adole kpo Olowoyi ka ni ayikoko nu tono dala ni.<verse eid="2PE 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3" />Kikyikyo, nyya yimu shala gye mi ishi ni ese ya kweyi ase shishini ni imu koza bwowe bibi yuwi ikweyi kpo ni ba wa bose. Aba yaleye. <verse eid="2PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4" />Kweyi aba doka mo, &lt;&lt;Oshokoyi manu ya wa, kwe olemani lo? Oye ebenya? Awokyikyi ka kwobonu gekwu wa, ojoji ke le byo ni ole nekye-nekye ni ayese ni!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2PE 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5" />Aya bya agye lo ni, nekye-nekye Owuso kela kweyi iso kpo okpagye bose. Oyo okpagye kpi inyo kweyi yi inyo shogba to, <verse eid="2PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6" />bwebe kinyo mani, inyo ni kye ni, pini oyese nekye kpo la. <verse eid="2PE 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7" />Iso kpo okpagye ka anani yaba bwebe kela oye kponu ni Owuso ka ni, shini ola nawa yuwa yi. Oyuwa shagye gbeyi ke eno ni aba wa kwa awase ni gyo Owuso lo epwo kweyi yuwa ngmo ni. <verse eid="2PE 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8" />Ayene hin moshi, nyya yimu shini ala ka nwanyi kpoza mani lo, ebe ka Adole eno oye le bya ashayi okpakwu oye kweyi ashayi okpakwu oye le bye eno oye. <verse eid="2PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9" />Adole ya kwasu ko yoza ni oshokoyi byoni ase shishini ba ma mo owe ni la lo, oke gbotumene kpala la, ikweyi koni oya yimu shini ashishe kala na ka gekwu lo, oke ya yimu shini ase kpiri na shagbotu. <verse eid="2PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10" />Eno ka Adole ke yawa byo owi. Eno oni iso ya gebi kpo egba ngmongmo loshu-loshu, ola ya yawoza kpiri ni biso ni yi kweyi ese kpoza ni banu kpiri ni ba gebi. <verse eid="2PE 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11" />Koni aba yojoji ya yishi mani, edo kasuse wonya ni ala shu ko owe? Ala shu ko bagye neshi kweyi yoza ni Owuso ya yimu, <verse eid="2PE 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12" />byoni ala ba gbeyi ke Eno ko Owuso ni kweyi ala takirikwu shala yo na wa papa, Eno ni iso kpiri ya wa yola, kweyi ola ya yawoza ni biso ni sa kpiri. <verse eid="2PE 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13" />Aha ke ba gbeyi koza ni Owuso shokoyi ni: iso pepe kpo okpagye pepe, ole ni ase ba yoza neshi ni.<verse eid="2PE 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14" />Mani oni, Ayene hin moshi, byoni ala ba gbeyi ke eno oni, ala takirikwu shala wase neshi ni gbepwo lo ni ebe ko Owuso kweyi ala bagye komene. <verse eid="2PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15" />Nyya yimu shala gye mo otumene ka Adole mani daha ishi ko pyo olayi, byoni oyene ka ko Obulus ta dala ni, kpo oziyi ni Owuso danu ni. <verse eid="2PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16" />Oza ni okela ikweyi wa ipu ka awokpa nu kpiri ni oma. Agba awoza shishini ni oka ipu ko okpa nu ni lono ko gyikweyi nu ni, kweyi awase ni gyoza lo ke hagye loshu ipu ko Okristi lo ni ba koye hoha, byoni aba ya kpo Okpa ka Awobane shishini ni. Mani oni abyebi wa yiyiwa re.<verse eid="2PE 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17" />Ni ole mani oni, ayene hin moshi, koni ala kwobonu gyoza mani ni, ala gbera ikweyi kawase ni gyo ono lo ni, shini ana ka yala kpo sho obutu ko Owuso lo. <verse eid="2PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18" />Ala ke gohobu ko gye ipu ke eshi kpo ogyogye ka Adole kpo Olowoyi ka Oyesu Okristi. Igyashi wakakanu anani kpo gbogbo-gbogbo! Nalemani.<verse eid="2PE 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3" />
</usx>